trait-language-foreigner-extreme-name = Foreigner Extreme
trait-language-foreigner-extreme-desc =
    You can't understand the common language, Tau-Ceti Basic, and while you require a translator, you currently don't have one.
    Due to lacking a translator, you will be forced to speak only in the languages you've chosen.

