chat-language-Sychian-name = Sychian
language-Sychian-name = Sychian

language-Sychian-description =
    A somewhat archaic, older language spoken through thought and transmitted psychic brainwaves rather than actual speech. This has given it a short, repetitive style of speaking.
    The language is not the most common due to it mostly being found in certain circles of mages and psychics. As a consequence of the method of speech, this language cannot be used over the radio.

